## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **`git pull` dismissed initially** — I wrongly said "skip pull" assuming local was ahead-only; origin was actually ahead 2 (PR #30 themes + status:ACTIVE). Lesson: always `git fetch` + check divergence before asserting. Recovered via merge.
- **`git merge` blocked by `webapp/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo`** — local working-tree change to a tracked build artifact aborted the merge. Fix: `git checkout -- webapp/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` then merge.
- **push hook `verify-trio-on-push` fails environmentally** — runs `npm run typecheck` from a cwd where `tsc` isn't on PATH → "'tsc' is not recognized". NOT a code failure. Override with trailing `# no-verify` AFTER verifying manually from `webapp/`.
- **`selectSkills({})` returned only 2** — I misread this as "Polina sees only 2 skills". WRONG: that's the auto-APPLY selector (unconditional skills only); Polina's `listSkills` does a full disk scan (all statuses). ~12 skills are ACTIVE. Corrected.
- **"папочка тем на гите" — incompatible** — FILMS/ is git-ignored; studio git (Tier-1) holds NO film content (CLAUDE.md §2). So themes must be DB assets, not git files. (Director agreed → per-theme assets.)
- **Polina chat wrote into a DEAD thread** — today's SS-S15 theme chat appended to thread `bdbdafcf` (created 2026-05-11, E12, `ended_at` set). Root cause: `chat/route.ts` ~line 183 checks `if(!existing)` but NOT `existing.ended_at` → appends to ended thread. (This is q9a Part B1.)
- **Polina's theme answer truncated + "добавь в themes" no-op** — her 14:07 reply cut off mid-sentence (heavy judging hit output-token limit), and she has NO tool to write the theme bank (route exists, tool doesn't). Both addressed in plan q9a (Part A proposeTheme + later raise max-output).
- **`node /tmp/x.mjs` can't resolve @supabase/supabase-js** — ESM resolves from the file's location; one-off scripts must live UNDER `webapp/` (e.g. `webapp/scripts/_tmp.mjs`, delete after).

