## Decisions Made

- **Themes = per-theme DB assets** `SPC-theme_{slug}` (NOT git files; NOT one monolith). No DB migration (file_type regex allows SPC-suffix). Reuse Bible multi-asset pattern.
- **Curation status in `metadata.theme_status`** (`approved|draft|invalidated`), free any→any via PATCH — NOT the asset status enum (which renames the file per flip). Director: all themes in one index with status badges, any→any moves.
- **"New conversation" not "Clear chat"** — archive (ended_at) + fresh thread, NON-destructive (history preserved). Name conveys it.
- **dispatch_intent unique key = (episode,shot,agent)** WITHOUT input_hash (input_hash in key would re-open E12 SH10 double-render).
- **S2(c) subsumed by S2(b).** next-events 6-fork collapse deferred to S6/S7 (anti-additive; seam not load-bearing).
- **Bible §34 Seed Bank (≈486 tok, 11% of general_idea) leaves the Bible** → themes surface; Bible v02 minus §34, Director LOCKs.

